*Methodological declaration: This synthesis was produced through structured integration of five large language model outputs. It does not constitute a systematic review or a formal GRADE evidence synthesis. All citations should be independently verified before use in academic publication or policy submission. Where evidence is described as strong, this reflects the consensus of model outputs and an assessment of study design and replication; it is not a formal GRADE evaluation. The synthesis is suitable for use as a framework document for further primary evidence synthesis or as a structured basis for a narrative or scoping review manuscript.*